    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: September 22, 2026.</em></p>
    <h2>Cookies we use</h2>
    <p><strong>None.</strong> Minepedia itself sets no first-party cookies: no login cookies, no preference cookies, no tracking cookies.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>Our analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics) is cookieless by design and does not identify individual visitors.</p>
    <h2>Third-party cookies</h2>
    <p>This site shows ads through Google AdSense. Google and its ad partners may set cookies for ad personalization and measurement. You can control or disable personalized ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">Google Ads Settings</a>, and clear or block cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>
